window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Death isn’t the end. Surrender is overrated.</p> <p>Killing for love is the only cure…I fear nothing, no one.</p> <p>Not even the boys who loved me that I lost. Dead. Buried. Gone. One by one. I am alone.</p> <p>I need to be stronger. I have to evolve If I’m to survive. If I’m going to save us all.</p> <p>Jude is my rock. Lorcan is my faith. Dante is my blade. Dino was the light to my darkness.</p> <p>And me…I’m the monster who comes in the night. I’m the bitch back from hell to make you weep. My father will know it when I slice him and every last one of his sinners into pretty ribbons for what they did to me…To my family.</p> <p>And in the end, they will beg.</p> <p>Love, honor, and obey.</p> <p>Not f*cking likely.</p> <p>I’d rather slaughter them all.</p>"; 
